getOfferedServices [SimTalk]
Returns all services which are offered by Exporters/Workers that are managed by the Broker designated by
<Path>, and writes them into a table.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.getOfferedServices([Services:table]) → table
Parameter
The optional parameter Services of data type table designates the name of the table. The subtable lists all
Exporters/Workers offering the service.
Examples
MyBroker.getOfferedServices(MyOfferedServicesTable) 
// Writes the offered services to the table MyOfferedServicesTable.
MyBroker.getOfferedServices 
// Writes the offered services to a table which is the return value.
See also
Offered Services [Broker]
